# Dubiel Release Notes

## 0.0.1 (21 Jul 2026)

* Initial release
* Renamed the package/app from `dugiel` to `Dubiel` throughout (icons, bundle
  id, module layout) ahead of the public release
* Fixed a `.gitignore` bug that had excluded the entire `tests/` suite from
  version control since the first commit
* Fixed `analysis_runner.validate()` to reject an incomplete manual ladder
  (a marker clicked without a typed kDa value), matching its documented
  contract
* Fixed `correlate._protein_lane_pct()` to average replicate gels of the same
  protein into one row instead of double-counting them as distinct proteins
  in the combined correlation heatmaps
* Added GitHub Actions build-and-release workflow (Windows MSI, macOS DMG
  arm64/x86_64, Linux AppImage) and a Read the Docs scaffold
